WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:00.700
They look.

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:01.740
They leave.

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.215
Leo wonders why.

00:00:03.665 --> 00:00:06.090
Meet Leo, a furniture shop owner.

00:00:06.165 --> 00:00:08.660
Every day, people browse and walk away.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.535
He has clues: what they looked at,

00:00:10.585 --> 00:00:12.535
almost bought, and paid for.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.085
But those clues sit in different places.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.360
His next offer is still a guess.

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:19.510
Who should he reach, and with what?

00:00:19.817 --> 00:00:22.442
Could AI help bring those customers back?

00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:26.592
Meet Market Metro: a simulated commerce environment

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.742
where agents observe shoppers, train models, and

00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:31.217
test campaigns.

00:00:31.292 --> 00:00:33.667
Then we measure whether those decisions actually

00:00:33.717 --> 00:00:34.467
help.

00:00:34.983 --> 00:00:37.158
It starts by connecting the clues.

00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:40.533
Our ontology connects shoppers, products, contacts and

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:43.008
payments, so each prediction uses the right

00:00:43.058 --> 00:00:44.308
examples.

00:00:44.408 --> 00:00:47.058
Recommendations stay separate from inquiries.

00:00:47.158 --> 00:00:50.433
One rule: past signals become inputs; later

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.308
outcomes become labels.

00:00:52.383 --> 00:00:54.733
The model can't peek into the future.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.875
With that map, the agent studies demand

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.250
and stock, selects twenty eight days of

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.875
history, and asks local tools to train

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.225
two models.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.725
Every choice is saved in a checkpoint.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.231
A prediction isn't enough.

00:01:09.231 --> 00:01:12.306
The verifier tests both candidates, checking PayPal

00:01:12.306 --> 00:01:15.654
and merchant outcomes under matching conditions.

00:01:15.654 --> 00:01:18.182
The winner earns its place through measured

00:01:18.182 --> 00:01:21.325
results; otherwise, the current policy stays.

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:24.575
Now follow one recommendation.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.475
On day thirty five, it reaches a

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.425
shopper who's been quiet for sixteen days.

00:01:29.475 --> 00:01:31.350
They buy a ninety six dollar side

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.150
table.

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:33.725
It arrives tomorrow.

00:01:33.775 --> 00:01:36.975
Under fixed rules, that request went unfilled.

00:01:37.483 --> 00:01:40.492
That purchase connects to PayPal Sandbox.

00:01:40.492 --> 00:01:42.784
It captures the same ninety six dollar

00:01:42.784 --> 00:01:46.008
order, showing the fee and merchant proceeds.

00:01:46.008 --> 00:01:48.444
Each record links back to the warehouse,

00:01:48.444 --> 00:01:50.808
so one purchase is counted once.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.753
Across the same market: sixteen more purchases

00:01:54.753 --> 00:01:55.496
kept.

00:01:55.496 --> 00:01:58.132
Two thousand three hundred forty five dollars

00:01:58.132 --> 00:01:59.754
more payment volume.

00:01:59.754 --> 00:02:03.200
Over a thousand dollars more merchant contribution.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.497
And about a hundred fifteen dollars more

00:02:05.497 --> 00:02:07.863
modeled PayPal net, after AI cost.

00:02:07.863 --> 00:02:10.025
All compared with fixed rules.

00:02:11.683 --> 00:02:14.260
Follow the evidence in AG Grid: trained

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:18.009
models, agent decisions, and the PayPal receipt.

00:02:18.009 --> 00:02:20.118
Open a checkpoint to see what the

00:02:20.118 --> 00:02:22.773
agent knew, chose, and verified.

00:02:23.383 --> 00:02:25.558
For Leo, those questions now have tested

00:02:25.608 --> 00:02:26.608
answers.

00:02:26.708 --> 00:02:27.958
Market Metro.

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:31.058
Agentic commerce that learns, tests its ideas,

00:02:31.108 --> 00:02:32.408
and shows its work.
